        "original_id": "3e9d70b7-2089-508f-86f1-4ff1aa6ec2fe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2014 Australian counter-terrorism raids\n- Places: Goulburn Correctional Centre, High Risk Management Centre (SuperMax)\n- Concepts: AA security risk, remand, highest security prison in Australia\n\nFacts:\n- The High Risk Management Centre at Goulburn Correctional Centre, commonly called the SuperMax, opened in September 2001.\n- In the 2014 Australian counter-terrorism raids, one of the two arrestees became one of only two men on remand at Australia’s highest security prison because he was considered an AA security risk.",
